<title>UK: LME to issue stocks data Dec 24 but not on Dec 27.</title>
<headline>LME to issue stocks data Dec 24 but not on Dec 27.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1996-12-19</dateline>
<text>
<p>The London Metal Exchange (LME) advised that data on LME stocks will be issued as normal on Tuesday, December 24 but there will be no stock figures released on Friday, December 27.</p>
<p>The LME will release its twice-weekly stock data as normal on Tuesday, December 31 and Friday, January 3. --London Newsroom +44 71 542 8074</p>
</text>
